# SHA-256 digests of denylisted terms, one per line; # starts a comment.
# A term is normalized first: lowercase, every run of anything but letters
# and digits as one space. The guard hashes every 1- to 4-word run of each
# line it checks, and every 12-digit number, and fails on a digest listed here.
# Add terms with:
#   python3 .github/scripts/text_guard.py --hash-terms < terms.txt >> .github/text-guard.sha256
792cea25c9a09cadeef5c2857cffe3a80566fd6e0ffe098d90dd0a8f61cb0ca0
